#N canvas 0 50 900 520 10;
#X declare -path ../pd-externals/bela-workstation;
#X text 10 10 Rack on Bela: juno~ (channel 1) \, d50~ (2) \, cz4~ (3) \, pdoly8~ (4) at once \, mixed to outputs 1/2. Play another one by changing the Launchkey's Keys Channel \; the encoders (Custom 1) follow \, the pads (Drum mode \, channel 10) go to the instrument of the last note. Generated by rack/gen_rack.py. Externals and abstractions from pd-externals (branch pd) \; here d50_pcm.bin and the user banks., f 100;
#X obj 600 90 declare -path ../pd-externals/bela-workstation;
#N canvas 0 50 760 400 juno 0;
#X text 10 10 juno~ on channel 1: layer junocc 1 \, pads junopads 10 (when in focus) \, trim x1.57., f 81;
