#X text 10 10 Focus: the channel of the last note on channels 1-4 (the Launchkey's Keys Channel) -> rack-focus 1-4: only that instrument's pads pass on \; a change shows its name and sends its pad colours., f 100;
#X obj 10 60 r rack-note;
#X obj 10 90 unpack f f f;
